# Container data and media, bind-mounted by docker-compose (DATA_DIR,
# DOWNLOADS_DIR, MOVIES_DIR, TV_DIR in .env). Never commit these — they hold
# live databases, API keys and multi-GB media files. Anchored with a leading
# slash so apps/downloads/ and templates/downloads/ aren't caught.
/data/
/downloads/
/movies/
/tv/
# The same folders when DATA_DIR is the repo itself (README's Unraid example)
/postgres/
/redis/
/qbt/
/plex/
/sonarr/
/radarr/
/prowlarr/

